
🚀 Built an AI-Powered Intelligent Resume Screening & Recruitment Recommendation System! hashtag#awspartyrock

I’m excited to share a project I’ve been working on to make AI-driven recruitment smarter, fairer, and more explainable. 🤖📄
Instead of relying only on keyword matching, this system follows a 9-stage intelligent pipeline:

🔐 Privacy Layer — Detects and redacts PII for anonymized processing
📑 Multimodal Analysis — Understands resume structure and content
🧠 Skill Extraction — Maps skills to a domain-agnostic skill ontology
🔄 Transferability Analysis — Identifies transferable skills across domains
🎯 JD Matching — Generates a detailed resume-to-job matching score
🌱 Cold-Start Handling — Supports sparse candidates and niche roles
⏳ Temporal Relevance — Considers skill recency and future readiness
⚖️ Fairness Ranking — Incorporates bias detection and fairness-aware scoring
💡 Explainable Recommendation — Provides a transparent hire/no-hire recommendation

The goal is not just to answer “Does this resume match the job?”, but also:
👉 Why does it match?
👉 Which skills are missing?
👉 Which skills are transferable?
👉 How relevant are the candidate’s recent skills?
👉 Is the ranking fair and explainable?

I’m particularly interested in the intersection of Generative AI, NLP, intelligent recruitment, explainable AI, and responsible AI.
This project has also helped me explore how AI can move beyond simple automation toward more transparent and human-centered decision support.


